(d) the details of schemes and measures being implemented to ensure affordable, accessible and quality education for every child?

(a) whether Government hospitals frequently refer emergency and critical patients to higher medical institutions or private hospitals instead of providing treatment at the available level, Government's assessment of this issue and the steps being taken to prevent unnecessary referrals;
