(c) the number of complaints received against private hospitals during the last five years and the actions taken in such cases?

(a) whether schemes and programmes are being implemented by Government for the restoration and rejuvenation of rivers, lakes, wetlands, ponds, village tanks, baolis, johads, and other traditional water bodies across the country;
