(c) the number of complaints received during the last five years, year-wise and country-wise; and 
(d) the number of such cases successfully resolved and repatriated safely to India during the last five years?

(a) whether during National Highway (NH) construction, old and mature trees are uprooted, if so, whether Government has explored any alternative engineering solutions to preserve such trees without hindering development work;
