(c) what steps are being taken to develop green belts, service road plantations and biodiversity corridors along National Highways in the State?

(a) whether Government manitain records of the total amount of debt waived off or written off in respect of corporates and farmers from April 2014 to the current financial year, if so, the details thereof for last five years;
