(c) whether Government has undertaken any comparative assessment of the impact of corporate debt write-offs and farmers' debt relief on public finances and economic equity?

(a) the number of routes made operational under the UDAN scheme in State of Punjab as on date;
(b) list of airports and destinations covered;
(c) total funds allocated and utilised under the said scheme in the State during the last five years; and
