(a) whether there are two railway underbridges in Sultanpur Lodhi where no protective sheds/roof structures have been constructed, causing serious inconvenience to pedestrians, commuters and local residents, especially during rains and extreme weather, if so, the reasons for non-provision of sheds at these locations; 
