(c) if not, the reasons therefor and whether there is any proposal to establish comprehensive monitoring framework for the same?

(a) whether Government, through its implementing agency NHAI, requires contractors to sign written agreements specifying the maintenance responsibility and defect liability period after the construction of National Highways;
