(c) the number of RTI applications filed, disposed of and rejected during the last five years, year-wise, along with major grounds for rejection?

(a) whether Government acknowledges that air pollution in major metropolitan cities and industrial clusters is largely a year-round, man-made problem driven by industrial emissions, thermal power plants, construction activities, road dust and increasing vehicular pollution rather than merely a seasonal phenomenon;
